 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Not at all. Many people learn a second language in their forties or fifties. Probably, but that's part of the fun. Start with easy words and the basic greetings, and speak slowly. Portuguese is beautiful, but it's hard for English speakers. Greek is lovely, and you' already got the beach. Whichever one you enjoy more will stick better. With basic grammar and vocab, an app, and a little book of words and sentences. You can practice with a friend or at language exchange meetups.",
